            Brand Guide
          </span>
          <span class="bg-green-500 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
            Updated September 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Bowflex <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">Treadmills</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          The treadmills are decent and the ownership story is the part nobody explains. Bowflex is now under the same roof as Horizon and Matrix, and that is the most useful fact for a buyer or an existing owner.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="#ownership" class="bg-[#FF5A1F] hover:bg-[#E64F16] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
