          <SocialProof users="3.5k" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose my-10 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-gray-900">On the numbers and the corporate history.</strong>
          Specifications here are the manufacturer’s published figures cross-checked against
