          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The hardware is competent and <strong class="text-white">decline is the genuine
            differentiator</strong>. The more useful fact is corporate: Bowflex now sits under
            Johnson Health Tech alongside Horizon and Matrix, which turns a post-bankruptcy brand
            from a parts risk into an ordinary one.
          </p>
